the entry and the better divers can do this you think they're in trouble when they hit the water but they pull the air down with them and it minimizes the splash his angle was slightly off too but only catch that on the second look Roger this is the judges just don't see everything it's too quick and he's got an eighty six point four nearly as good as last night's eighty eight two

