01:46:31,685 --> 01:46:34,708
But from Colombia down to Brazil, it's not that far, is it?

1125
01:46:34,729 --> 01:46:38,314
He might just be tempted to go one more cycle.

1126
01:46:38,453 --> 01:46:38,854
I wonder.

1127
01:46:39,555 --> 01:46:40,837
That'll be his decision, of course.

1128
01:46:41,797 --> 01:46:42,298
79.2.

1129
01:46:42,859 --> 01:46:43,640
Well done.

1130
01:46:43,621 --> 01:47:07,856
training so demanding though trying to carry two careers and compete at the very highest level that's tough Anton Zakharov down in 15th place he collapsed in his program a little bit back two and a half somersault two and a half twist well he's a little bit of a chance here with a 3.6 tariff on this one

1131
