1246
01:58:16,055 --> 01:58:19,939
Diver of the year for the governing body, Fina, last year.

1247
01:58:19,979 --> 01:58:25,064
And another tantalizing display from him.

1248
01:58:25,626 --> 01:58:26,686
Going to be great tonight.

1249
01:58:27,257 --> 01:58:28,460
Well, very close to the 197.2.

1250
01:58:28,881 --> 01:58:31,244
He's the top man.

1251
01:58:33,488 --> 01:58:34,451
He is the one to beat.

1252
01:58:34,490 --> 01:58:35,893
They are the ones to beat.

1253
01:58:35,953 --> 01:58:37,256
The two Chinese divers.

1254
01:58:38,056 --> 01:58:41,622
Tom Daly getting a massive cheer as he leaves the pool.

1255
01:58:41,923 --> 01:58:42,824
Fourth place.

1256
01:58:43,447 --> 01:58:44,649
Matthew Mitchum, though.

1257
01:58:45,048 --> 01:58:46,532
He will be devastated.

1258
