1259
01:58:51,650 --> 01:58:54,313
No opportunity to defend his Olympic title.

1260
01:58:55,173 --> 01:58:59,018
So there's one that the rest of the field does not have to worry about.

1261
01:58:59,337 --> 01:59:01,479
And he could have been a threat, but he didn't make it.

1262
01:59:01,859 --> 01:59:04,703
David Boudia has come out of this from 18th up to third.

1263
01:59:06,043 --> 01:59:08,627
Martin Wolfram just behind Tom Daley there.

1264
01:59:08,646 --> 01:59:10,748
Minibaev, McCrory, Sascha Klein.

1265
01:59:11,208 --> 01:59:12,350
Germany doing well.

1266
01:59:12,850 --> 01:59:15,252
Jose Guerra making the cuts.

1267
01:59:17,984 --> 01:59:22,469
Even Garcia, Alexander Bondar, Riley McCormack scrambling aboard.

1268
01:59:22,548 --> 01:59:30,158
The big headline to miss out Matthew Mitchum and German Sanchez as well who was so promising before also misses the boat.

1269
01:59:30,217 --> 01:59:47,838
Gleb Galperin too will be disappointed as will those six who don't go forward but Matthew Mitchum is the negative headline story if you like from tonight and I'll save you any accusations and bias to say that from an impartial point of view the competition will be a little bit

1270
01:59:47,819 --> 01:59:52,277
the less for the for the lack of someone like him.

1271
01:59:56,323 --> 01:59:59,029
So he can't really have any complaints, Roger.

1272
01:59:59,048 --> 02:00:02,296
He missed that 12th position by some 13 points.

1273
02:00:03,197 --> 02:00:11,193
We know he's come here less than in the condition he was four years ago, not able to throw the difficulty into some dives, but he didn't finish well.

1274
02:00:11,233 --> 02:00:19,108
He had the opportunity to confirm his place, wasn't able to make the most of that last dive that had the highest tariff, and so

1275
02:00:19,087 --> 02:00:22,996
He can have no complaints.

1276
02:00:23,617 --> 02:00:34,279
He knew what his limitations were coming here and as much as we like watching him dive, I think if he'd made the 12 in the form that we've seen from him, he wasn't going to threaten for the medals.

1277
02:00:35,305 --> 02:00:39,230
His personality, though, is something that adds to the whole sense of occasion here.

1278
02:00:39,591 --> 02:00:49,868
Mind you, this competition so far today has really cranked up the anticipation and Tom Daly's progress will certainly crank up the volume.

1279
02:00:50,128 --> 02:00:52,112
There'll be 17,000 in here tonight.

1280
02:00:52,192 --> 02:00:56,139
It is one of the top tickets in town, if you were lucky enough to get it.

1281
02:00:57,000 --> 02:01:01,988
And really, the level of competition has risen here because

1282
02:01:01,967 --> 02:01:10,306
It was fierce especially for that last place on board and we've got an idea of what is to come tonight.

1283
02:01:10,979 --> 02:01:12,240
It's going to be a great competition.

1284
02:01:13,162 --> 02:01:15,027
The crowd will lift the roof off for Tom Daley.

1285
02:01:15,627 --> 02:01:22,400
There'll be generous applause and real excitement about what the two top Chinese competitors have for Chou Bo and Lin Ye.

1286
02:01:23,403 --> 02:01:28,273
And Budaya coming from last qualifying position to third.

1287
02:01:29,154 --> 02:01:33,122
Maybe he's got more to offer as well, but so much to look forward to, Roger.

1288
02:01:35,244 --> 02:01:44,256
So can anyone produce the performances to challenge these Chinese divers who have shown their nerve and their skill.

1289
02:01:44,275 --> 02:01:51,404
They're impassive on the outside and they just let their diving do the talking.

1290
02:01:52,404 --> 02:01:57,251
Matthew Mitchum waves farewell though to this Olympic final.

1291
02:01:57,411 --> 02:01:59,453
We're back here tonight at seven o'clock.

1292
02:01:59,774 --> 02:02:00,595
It'll be great.

1293
02:02:06,667 --> 02:02:10,289
Platform final, the last event here in this diving pool.

1294
02:02:10,832 --> 02:02:12,221
Make sure you don't miss it.

